sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as odh-model-controller<br/>Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant MSAPI as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Dashboard as Dashboard / CLI
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,Controller: Flow 1: InferenceService Deployment
        User->>K8sAPI: POST InferenceService CR<br/>Auth: Bearer / OIDC
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>Admission webhook (TLS)
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated / Validated
        K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (InferenceService)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Route<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Role + RoleBinding<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Secrets<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Dashboard,MSAPI: Flow 2: Gateway Discovery
        Dashboard->>MSAPI: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>Auth: Bearer token<br/>TLS 1.2+
        MSAPI->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>Auth: User token (impersonation)
        K8sAPI-->>MSAPI: Authorized
        MSAPI->>K8sAPI: List Gateways<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>MSAPI: Gateway list
        MSAPI-->>Dashboard: JSON response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over K8sAPI,Controller: Flow 3: LLM-D Gateway Bootstrap
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (LLMInferenceService CR)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create EnvoyFilter<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodMonitor<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch Gateway resource<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over MSAPI,OTel: Observability
        MSAPI->>OTel: OTLP/gRPC traces<br/>Configured
    end
